        <img src="/brand/meeko-logo.webp" width="34" height="34" alt="" />
        <span>Meeko</span>
      </a>
      <nav class="primary" aria-label="Principal">
        <a bind:href="guide">Guía</a>
        <a bind:href="api">API</a>
        <a bind:href="changes">Cambios</a>
      </nav>
      <div class="tools">
        <SearchDialog />
        <ThemeToggle model="theme" />
        <a class="github" href="https://github.com/meekojs/meeko" rel="noopener" aria-label="Meeko en GitHub">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 .5a11.5 11.5 0 0 0-3.64 22.41c.58.1.79-.25.79-.56v-2c-3.2.7-3.87-1.37-3.87-1.37-.53-1.33-1.28-1.69-1.28-1.69-1.05-.71.08-.7.08-.7 1.16.08 1.77 1.19 1.77 1.19 1.03 1.77 2.7 1.26 3.36.96.1-.75.4-1.26.73-1.55-2.55-.29-5.24-1.28-5.24-5.69 0-1.26.45-2.29 1.19-3.09-.12-.29-.52-1.46.11-3.05 0 0 .97-.31 3.17 1.18a11 11 0 0 1 5.77 0c2.2-1.49 3.17-1.18 3.17-1.18.63 1.59.23 2.76.11 3.05.74.8 1.19 1.83 1.19 3.09 0 4.42-2.69 5.39-5.26 5.68.41.36.78 1.06.78 2.14v3.17c0 .31.21.67.8.56A11.5 11.5 0 0 0 12 .5Z" /></svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>
  <main id="contenido">
    <component is="props.outlet"></component>
  </main>
  <footer class="site-footer">
    <div class="inner">
      <p>
        <img src="/brand/meeko-logo.webp" width="22" height="22" alt="" />
        <span>Hecho con Meeko: cada página de este sitio es un componente <code>.meeko</code> prerenderizado.</span>
      </p>
      <p>
        <span>Licencia <a href="https://github.com/meekojs/meeko/blob/main/LICENSE" rel="noopener">MIT</a> ·
        <a href="https://www.npmjs.com/package/@meekojs/meeko" rel="noopener">npm</a> ·
        <a href="https://github.com/meekojs/meeko" rel="noopener">GitHub</a></span>
